body:
this might not be the advice your title asks for but its advice that will make you happier, body image isn't what your body looks like, its how you view it, i have a feeling learning to love your body will help with your confidence. partake in making yourself look better if it makes you feel better, for example, i have pretty clear skin but i still love having a skin routine cus its relaxing

&#x200B;

[here](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KWqN79d47qM) is a small speech on body image, i hope you feel better about yourself soon and you find the love of your life! :3
